coring-agent.fingerprint\n   687→        scope: backend/synthetics/fingerprint.py — compute_fingerprint(digest, contract)\n   688→          produces stable JSON per candidate\n   689→      - id: synthetics-scoring-agent.diff\n   690→        scope: backend/synthetics/diff.py — diff_against_baseline(fingerprint, baseline,\n   691→          contract) returns DriftReport\n   692→      - id: synthetics-scoring-agent.cli\n   693→        scope: backend/synthetics/cli.py — python -m backend.synthetics run\n   694→          --suite=scoring\n   695→      - id: synthetics-scoring-agent.cache-verification\n   696→        scope: backend/synthetics/scoring_runner.py — verify cache_creation_input_tokens\n   697→          == 0 on subsequent runs\n   698→  - id: synthetics-crawler-agent\n   699→    scope: Upstream health monitoring with state machine alerts for consecutive\n   700→      failures\n   701→    branch: feat/synthetics-crawler-agent\n   702→    blocked_by:\n   703→      - synthetics-fixtures-agent\n   704→    blocks: []\n   705→    capabilities:\n   706→      - httpx\n   707→      - redis-pubsub\n   708→      - structlog\n   709→    sub_agents:\n   710→      - id: synthetics-crawler-agent.runner\n   711→        scope: backend/synthetics/crawler_health.py — CrawlerHealthRunner.run_suite()\n   712→          hits known-good slugs per source\n   713→      - id: synthetics-crawler-agent.schemas\n   714→        scope: backend/synthetics/expected_schema_v1.json — expected top-level shape for\n   715→          Greenhouse/Lever/Ashby\n   716→      - id: synthetics-crawler-agent.state-machine\n   717→        scope: synthetics/state.json — consecutive_failures tracking with 3-strike alert\n   718→          threshold\n   719→      - id: synthetics-crawler-agent.beat-extension\n   720→        scope: backend/synthetics/beat_schedule.py — hourly Celery beat entry for\n   721→          crawler health, registered additively\n   722→merge_order:\n   723→  - data-agent\n   724→  - design-a