{"t":"2026-05-28T03:46:37.476Z","event":"sdk_msg","msg":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0185LLVzampC9Q86JBVt7UDg","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Copyright 2026 VibeSpace LLC\n     2→# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0\n     3→\n     4→\"\"\"\n     5→Backend synthetics package for Talent Agent.\n     6→\n     7→Provides deterministic scoring drift detection via:\n     8→    - ScoringSyntheticRunner: Iterates synthetic candidates × JDs\n     9→    - compute_fingerprint: Produces stable JSON fingerprints\n    10→    - diff_against_baseline: Compares fingerprints for drift\n    11→    - DriftReport: Drift comparison result with severity\n    12→\n    13→Contract: NUTRIENTS.md §I.2-I.5, HYPHA-SYNTHETICS-SCORING.md\n    14→\"\"\"\n    15→\n    16→from backend.synthetics.diff import (\n    17→    DriftReport,\n    18→    DriftViolation,\n    19→    diff_against_baseline,\n    20→    has_drift,\n    21→    is_critical,\n    22→    format_summary,\n    23→)\n    24→from backend.synthetics.fingerprint import (\n    25→    FingerprintContract,\n    26→    ScoringFingerprint,\n    27→    compute_fingerprint,\n    28→    load_baseline,\n    29→    save_baseline,\n    30→)\n    31→from backend.synthetics.scoring_runner import ScoringSyntheticRunner\n    32→\n    33→__all__ = [\n    34→    # Runner\n    35→    \"ScoringSyntheticRunner\",\n    36→    # Fingerprint\n    37→    \"FingerprintContract\",\n    38→    \"ScoringFingerprint\",\n    39→    \"compute_fingerprint\",\n    40→    \"load_baseline\",\n    41→    \"save_baseline\",\n    42→    # Diff\n    43→    \"DriftReport\",\n    44→    \"DriftViolation\",\n    45→    \"diff_against_baseline\",\n    46→    \"has_drift\",\n    47→    \"is_critical\",\n    48→    \"format_summary\",\n    49→]\n    50→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d03d3d20-5f6b-41a7-88e6-34cec2448ac8","uuid":"783a7cff-8a5e-437f-9b6b-2e23cbba0ed3","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/spy/mfautomations/repos/creation-station/reverse-search/backend/synthetics/__init__.py","content":"# Copyright 2026 VibeSpace LLC\n# Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0\n\n\"\"\"\nBackend synthetics package for Talent Agent.\n\nProvides deterministic scoring drift detection via:\n    - ScoringSyntheticRunner: Iterates synthetic candidates × JDs\n    - compute_fingerprint: Produces stable JSON fingerprints\n    - diff_against_baseline: Compares fingerprints for drift\n    - DriftReport: Drift comparison result with severity\n\nContract: NUTRIENTS.md §I.2-I.5, HYPHA-SYNTHETICS-SCORING.md\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom backend.synthetics.diff import (\n    DriftReport,\n    DriftViolation,\n    diff_against_baseline,\n    has_drift,\n    is_critical,\n    format_summary,\n)\nfrom backend.synthetics.fingerprint import (\n    FingerprintContract,\n    ScoringFingerprint,\n    compute_fingerprint,\n    load_baseline,\n    save_baseline,\n)\nfrom backend.synthetics.scoring_runner import ScoringSyntheticRunner\n\n__all__ = [\n    # Runner\n    \"ScoringSyntheticRunner\",\n    # Fingerprint\n    \"FingerprintContract\",\n    \"ScoringFingerprint\",\n    \"compute_fingerprint\",\n    \"load_baseline\",\n    \"save_baseline\",\n    # Diff\n    \"DriftReport\",\n    \"DriftViolation\",\n    \"diff_against_baseline\",\n    \"has_drift\",\n    \"is_critical\",\n    \"format_summary\",\n]\n","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":50}}}}
